window.JEX_DASHBOARD_UNITS = [{"unit":1,"theme":"A deal is a deal. – End of discussion.","cards":[{"w":"A deal is a deal.","p":"phr.","d":"you must do what you promised","c":"說好的事就要算數","s":"A: Can you do my chores tomorrow instead? I'm too tired today. B: No way! _____ _____ _____ _____ _____. You promised to wash the dishes tonight."},{"w":"a piece of cake","p":"phr.","d":"something very easy to do","c":"輕而易舉","s":"A: Was the English quiz hard this morning? B: No, it was _____ _____ _____ _____ because I studied all the new words last night."},{"w":"a typhoon hits + 地方","p":"phr.","d":"a typhoon comes and hurts a place","c":"颱風襲擊⋯⋯","s":"When _____ _____ _____ Taiwan in the summer, many trees fall down, so people should stay at home and stay safe."},{"w":"adj./adv. + enough","p":"phr.","d":"as much as needed (after adj./adv.)","c":"足夠……的（形容詞／副詞在前）","s":"Kevin is not tall _____ to reach the top shelf, so he has to stand on a chair to get the dictionary."},{"w":"after + 現在簡單式, S + 未來式","p":"phr.","d":"when one thing finishes, another thing will happen","c":"條件句：在某事發生之後，另一件事會接著發生","s":"_____ I finish my math homework this evening, I will play video games with my older brother for an hour."},{"w":"Am I clear?","p":"phr.","d":"Do you understand what I said?","c":"我說清楚了嗎？","s":"A: You must finish your homework before you play any video games tonight. _____ _____ _____? B: Yes, Mom, I understand."},{"w":"an earthquake hits + 地方","p":"phr.","d":"an earthquake shakes and hurts a place","c":"地震襲擊⋯⋯","s":"Last year, _____ _____ _____ the small town at night, but luckily nobody was hurt because the buildings were strong."},{"w":"Are you kidding?","p":"phr.","d":"Are you joking?","c":"你在開玩笑吧？","s":"A: Our teacher said we will have three tests tomorrow. B: _____ _____ _____? We just had a big test today!"},{"w":"as + adj./adv.(原級) + as","p":"phr.","d":"the same in some way as","c":"跟⋯⋯一樣⋯⋯","s":"My little sister is now _____ tall _____ my mother, and she is only twelve years old this year."},{"w":"as + adj./adv. + as possible","p":"phr.","d":"to the highest degree you can","c":"盡可能（地）……","s":"The bus was going to leave in five minutes, so Linda ran to the station _____ fast _____ _____ and just caught it."},{"w":"(as) poor as a church mouse","p":"phr.","d":"very, very poor","c":"一文不名；一貧如洗","s":"After Uncle Ray lost his job, he was _____ _____ _____ _____ _____ _____, so our family helped him pay his rent."},{"w":"be here to stay","p":"phr.","d":"will continue to exist for a long time","c":"成為常態；會長久存在","s":"Many people think online shopping _____ _____ _____ _____, because it is fast and easy for busy families."},{"w":"人 + be in one's teens/twenties/thirties","p":"phr.","d":"be aged 13–19, 20–29, or 30–39","c":"某人正值十幾歲／二十多歲／三十多歲","s":"My cousin _____ _____ her _____ now, so she likes to hang out with her friends more than with our family."},{"w":"before + 現在簡單式, S + 未來式","p":"phr.","d":"one thing will happen first, then another","c":"條件句：在某事發生之前，另一件事會先發生","s":"_____ my mom gets home from work tonight, I will wash all the dishes and clean the kitchen to surprise her."},{"w":"Best wishes","p":"phr.","d":"kind hopes written at the end of a card","c":"致上最誠摯的祝福","s":"At the end of her card to her old teacher, Wendy wrote, \"_____ _____ for a happy and healthy new year!\""},{"w":"Better late than never.","p":"phr.","d":"doing it late is better than not at all","c":"晚做總比不做好","s":"A: Sorry, I only finished my science report this morning, two days late. B: Well, _____ _____ _____ _____. Be on time next time."},{"w":"better than I thought","p":"phr.","d":"good in a way I did not expect","c":"比我想像的好","s":"The new noodle shop near our school was much _____ _____ _____ _____, so we plan to eat there again next week."},{"w":"can't get any better","p":"phr.","d":"is already the best it can be","c":"再好不過了","s":"We are at the beach, the sun is shining, and we all have ice cream in our hands, so life _____ _____ _____ _____!"},{"w":"can't help it","p":"phr.","d":"you cannot stop yourself from doing something","c":"忍不住；沒辦法控制","s":"I know I should stop eating chocolate before dinner, but I _____ _____ _____ because it tastes so good."},{"w":"Chances are (that) + 子句","p":"phr.","d":"it is likely that","c":"很可能⋯⋯","s":"The sky is dark and the wind is strong, so _____ _____ the baseball game will be stopped this afternoon."},{"w":"cost an arm and a leg","p":"phr.","d":"be very, very expensive","c":"非常昂貴；貴得嚇人（口語）","s":"The new game console looks really cool, but it _____ _____ _____ _____ _____ _____, so I will wait for a sale."},{"w":"Do you get it?","p":"phr.","d":"Do you understand it?","c":"你了解了嗎？","s":"A: First you add these two numbers, and then you divide the answer by three. _____ _____ _____ _____? B: Yes, now it looks easy."},{"w":"Do you mind + V-ing?","p":"phr.","d":"a polite question asking if something is OK","c":"你介意做⋯⋯嗎？","s":"A: _____ _____ _____ opening the window? It's really hot in here. B: Not at all. I'll open it for you."},{"w":"Don't be in my way.","p":"phr.","d":"please move; you are blocking me","c":"別擋我的路。","s":"A: Can I stand here and watch you cook the noodles, Mom? B: Sure, but _____ _____ _____ _____ _____, because the pot is very hot."},{"w":"Don't bother me.","p":"phr.","d":"stop annoying me; let me do my work","c":"別煩我","s":"A: Hey, do you want to play cards with us in the living room? B: _____ _____ _____ now. I'm studying for tomorrow's test."},{"w":"Don't cross + 人.","p":"phr.","d":"don't make someone angry","c":"別惹⋯⋯生氣","s":"A: Should I take Lisa's seat while she's away? B: No! _____ _____ Lisa. She gets really angry when people touch her things."},{"w":"Don't judge a book by its cover.","p":"phr.","d":"don't decide what someone is like from their looks","c":"不可貌相；別以貌取人","s":"A: The new boy looks scary, so I don't want to talk to him. B: _____ _____ _____ _____ _____ _____ _____. He's actually very kind."},{"w":"Don't mind me.","p":"phr.","d":"please go on; don't worry about me","c":"別管我；別在意我","s":"A: Oh, Grandpa, are you going to sit here with us? B: _____ _____ _____. I'm just reading my newspaper, so keep playing your game."},{"w":"Don't push me.","p":"phr.","d":"don't try to make me do something","c":"別逼我","s":"A: Come on, just tell me your secret. I'll give you my cookie! B: _____ _____ _____. I said I don't want to talk about it."},{"w":"End of discussion.","p":"phr.","d":"we will not talk about it anymore","c":"不再討論；討論到此為止","s":"A: Mom, can I stay up late and play games tonight? B: No, you have school tomorrow. _____ _____ _____."}]},{"unit":2,"theme":"even a baby can + VR – It's my pleasure to + VR","cards":[{"w":"even a baby can + VR","p":"phr.","d":"it is very easy; anyone can do it","c":"連嬰兒都能……（形容非常簡單）","s":"This new phone game is so easy that _____ _____ _____ _____ play it, so my grandpa wants to try it too."},{"w":"Excuse me.","p":"phr.","d":"a polite way to ask someone to move or listen","c":"借光；對不起（禮貌用語）","s":"A: _____ _____, could I get past? My bus stop is next. B: Oh, sure, sorry about that!"},{"w":"First things first.","p":"phr.","d":"do the most important thing first","c":"要事第一；先做重要的事","s":"A: Let's play video games now! B: _____ _____ _____. We need to finish our math homework before dinner."},{"w":"Good things never last.","p":"phr.","d":"happy times always end soon","c":"美好的事物總是不長久","s":"A: Our summer vacation is over already, and school starts tomorrow. B: I know. _____ _____ _____ _____."},{"w":"Handle with care.","p":"phr.","d":"move this carefully because it can break","c":"小心處理（常見於包裹標示）","s":"The box had glass cups inside, so Mom wrote \"_____ _____ _____\" on it before she sent it to Grandma."},{"w":"have + p.p. + before","p":"phr.","d":"did something at some time in the past","c":"以前曾經（做過）","s":"I _____ visited Tainan _____, so I can show you the best places to eat beef soup when we get there next week."},{"w":"Have you ever been to + 地方?","p":"phr.","d":"did you visit this place before?","c":"你曾經去過⋯⋯嗎？","s":"A: _____ _____ _____ _____ _____ Hualien? B: Yes, I went there with my family last summer and saw Taroko Gorge."},{"w":"Honesty is the best policy.","p":"phr.","d":"Telling the truth is always best.","c":"誠實為上策","s":"A: I broke Mom's favorite cup. Should I hide it? B: No, just tell her the truth. _____ _____ _____ _____ _____."},{"w":"I couldn't agree more.","p":"phr.","d":"I agree with you completely","c":"非常同意","s":"A: Our school should have more sports clubs, so students can exercise after class. B: _____ _____ _____ _____. I'd join the tennis club."},{"w":"I don't buy it.","p":"phr.","d":"I don't believe it.","c":"我不相信（口語）","s":"A: Tom says he finished all his homework in ten minutes. B: _____ _____ _____ _____. He always needs at least an hour!"},{"w":"I don't get it.","p":"phr.","d":"I do not understand.","c":"我不懂","s":"A: Everyone laughed at Tom's joke about the cat and the fish. B: _____ _____ _____ _____. Why is it so funny?"},{"w":"I don't mind.","p":"phr.","d":"it's OK with me","c":"我不介意","s":"A: Do you want to eat noodles or rice for dinner tonight? B: _____ _____ _____. Both are fine with me, so you can choose."},{"w":"I get it.","p":"phr.","d":"I understand now.","c":"我懂了","s":"A: You need to click this button first, and then the game will start. B: Oh, _____ _____ _____. Thanks for your help!"},{"w":"I second that.","p":"phr.","d":"I agree with what you just said","c":"我附議／我贊同（正式或幽默用法）","s":"A: I think we should order pizza for the class party because everyone likes it. B: _____ _____ _____. Let's get two big ones."},{"w":"I see.","p":"phr.","d":"I understand now.","c":"我了解了／我懂了","s":"A: The library is closed today because they are cleaning the floors and windows. B: _____ _____. I will come back tomorrow, then."},{"w":"I'd love/like to, but + 子句","p":"phr.","d":"a polite way to say no","c":"我很想…，但…（婉拒）","s":"A: Do you want to come to my birthday party on Saturday night? B: _____ _____ _____, _____ I have to visit my grandparents."},{"w":"If + 現在簡單式, S + 未來式","p":"phr.","d":"if this happens, another thing will happen","c":"條件句：如果某事發生，將會……","s":"_____ it rains tomorrow morning, our class will not go to the zoo, and we will watch a movie at school instead."},{"w":"If only + 子句","p":"phr.","d":"I really wish","c":"但願、要是……多好","s":"_____ _____ I had studied harder for the math test, I would not feel so worried about my grade now."},{"w":"I'll call you later.","p":"phr.","d":"I will phone you again soon","c":"我待會打給你","s":"A: Can we talk about the class trip now? B: Sorry, I'm on a noisy bus. _____ _____ _____ _____ when I get home."},{"w":"I'll pass.","p":"phr.","d":"No, thank you; I won't join.","c":"我跳過（我不參加）","s":"A: We're going to the haunted house at the night market. Do you want to come? B: _____ _____. I get scared too easily."},{"w":"It costs + 人 + 錢 + to + VR","p":"phr.","d":"doing something needs this much money","c":"做⋯⋯花了某人多少錢","s":"_____ _____ us five thousand dollars _____ fix the old car, so Dad decided to buy a new one next year."},{"w":"It doesn't count.","p":"phr.","d":"It is not accepted as real or right.","c":"不算；不被承認","s":"A: I got the ball into the basket, so our team wins! B: Sorry, _____ _____ _____ because your foot was on the line."},{"w":"It doesn't matter whether/if + 子句","p":"phr.","d":"something is not important either way","c":"不管⋯⋯都沒關係","s":"_____ _____ _____ _____ you win or lose the race, because the most important thing is to have fun with your friends."},{"w":"It doesn't ring a bell.","p":"phr.","d":"I don't remember it.","c":"想不起來；沒印象（口語）","s":"A: Do you remember a girl named Lily from our elementary school? B: Hmm, sorry, _____ _____ _____ _____ _____."},{"w":"It takes + 人 + 時間 + to + VR","p":"phr.","d":"someone needs this much time to do something","c":"花某人多少時間做…（= 人 spend + 時間 + V-ing）","s":"_____ _____ me twenty minutes _____ walk from my home to school, so I always leave before seven o'clock."},{"w":"It turns out that + 子句","p":"phr.","d":"in the end, we learn that","c":"結果是⋯⋯；原來⋯⋯","s":"We thought someone had stolen Dad's car, but _____ _____ _____ _____ he had parked it on another street."},{"w":"It turns out to be + N/adj.","p":"phr.","d":"in the end it is something","c":"結果是⋯⋯（某種狀態/身份）","s":"We were worried about the camping trip because of the storm, but _____ _____ _____ _____ _____ a sunny day."},{"w":"It was not until + 時間/子句 + that + 句子","p":"phr.","d":"only at that time did something happen","c":"直到⋯⋯才","s":"It was _____ _____ ten o'clock at night that my sister finally finished her homework and went to bed."},{"w":"It's beyond me.","p":"phr.","d":"I can't understand it.","c":"我不懂；超出我的理解","s":"A: Can you help me with this math question about circles? B: Sorry, _____ _____ _____. Let's ask Mr. Lin after class."},{"w":"It's my pleasure to + VR","p":"phr.","d":"I am happy and honored to do this","c":"很樂意做⋯⋯／是我的榮幸做⋯⋯","s":"Thank you all for coming to our school concert tonight, and _____ _____ _____ _____ introduce our wonderful music teacher, Ms. Lin."}]},{"unit":3,"theme":"It's my treat. – one's mind goes blank","cards":[{"w":"It's my treat.","p":"phr.","d":"I will pay for it","c":"我請客","s":"A: Let me pay for the bubble tea this time. B: No, no, _____ _____ _____. You paid for our lunch yesterday."},{"w":"It's my turn.","p":"phr.","d":"Now I can do it after others.","c":"輪到我了","s":"A: I have finished my turn on the swing, so who wants to go next? B: _____ _____ _____! I have been waiting for ten minutes."},{"w":"It's never too late to learn.","p":"phr.","d":"you can learn at any age","c":"活到老，學到老","s":"My grandpa started to learn English at seventy because he believes _____ _____ _____ _____ _____ _____."},{"w":"It's not a big deal.","p":"phr.","d":"It is not important; no problem.","c":"小事；沒什麼（= No biggie.）","s":"A: I'm so sorry that I forgot to bring your comic book back today. B: _____ _____ _____ _____ _____. You can give it to me tomorrow."},{"w":"It's now or never.","p":"phr.","d":"do it now or lose the chance","c":"機不可失；此時不做更待何時","s":"A: Should I ask Jenny to dance with me? The music ends in two minutes! B: _____ _____ _____ _____. Go and ask her!"},{"w":"It's on me.","p":"phr.","d":"I will pay (spoken)","c":"我請客（口語）","s":"A: How much was my hamburger? I want to pay you back. B: Don't worry about it. _____ _____ _____."},{"w":"It's sick!","p":"phr.","d":"slang: it is really cool or great","c":"太厲害了；超棒（俚語）","s":"A: Look at my new skateboard. My uncle bought it for me in the U.S. B: Wow, _____ _____! Can I try it after school?"},{"w":"It's time for + N","p":"phr.","d":"it is the right time to have or do something","c":"……的時間到了","s":"Put away your phones and wash your hands, everyone. _____ _____ _____ dinner, and Grandma made your favorite fried rice."},{"w":"It's time to + VR","p":"phr.","d":"it is the right time to do something","c":"該做……的時候到了","s":"It's already eleven o'clock and you have a test tomorrow morning, so _____ _____ _____ turn off the TV and go to bed."},{"w":"It's up to you.","p":"phr.","d":"You can decide.","c":"由你決定；看你怎麼選","s":"A: Should we eat noodles or pizza for dinner tonight? B: _____ _____ _____ _____. I'm happy with either one."},{"w":"It's your call.","p":"phr.","d":"you can decide","c":"由你決定；看你怎麼選","s":"A: Should we eat noodles or rice for lunch today? I don't mind either one. B: Well, _____ _____ _____, since you're paying!"},{"w":"I've got it covered.","p":"phr.","d":"I will take care of it; it is done","c":"搞定；處理好了","s":"A: Oh no, we forgot to buy drinks for the class party tomorrow! B: Don't worry, _____ _____ _____ _____. I'll bring them."},{"w":"kill it","p":"phr.","d":"do something really, really well (informal)","c":"表現超棒；很厲害（口語）","s":"Amy was nervous before her piano contest, but she really _____ _____ on stage, and everyone clapped for a long time."},{"w":"last but not least","p":"phr.","d":"the last one, but still important","c":"最後但同樣重要","s":"I want to thank my teachers, my classmates, and, _____ _____ _____ _____, my parents for always supporting me."},{"w":"Leave me alone.","p":"phr.","d":"go away; I want to be by myself","c":"讓我一個人靜一靜；別煩我","s":"A: Why are you crying? Did someone say something mean to you? B: Please just _____ _____ _____. I need some time to think."},{"w":"物 + makes + 人 + sick","p":"phr.","d":"something makes you feel ill or upset","c":"讓人作噁；令人反感／噁心","s":"The smell of the old garbage in the kitchen _____ me _____, so I opened all the windows right away."},{"w":"Mind your own business.","p":"phr.","d":"don't ask about things that are not about you","c":"少管閒事","s":"A: Who were you texting just now? Was it a boy from your class? B: _____ _____ _____ _____. It's not your problem!"},{"w":"Neither + 助動詞/be動詞 + 主詞.","p":"phr.","d":"me too, for a negative idea","c":"（前句否定）⋯⋯也不","s":"A: I don't like eating bitter melon because it tastes terrible. B: _____ do I. But my mom always makes me eat it."},{"w":"Never mind.","p":"phr.","d":"it's OK; don't worry about it","c":"沒關係；別在意","s":"A: I'm sorry, I forgot to bring the comic book you lent me. B: _____ _____. You can give it back next week."},{"w":"No kidding.","p":"phr.","d":"I am telling the truth; really.","c":"不騙你；真的","s":"A: Did you really see a famous singer at the MRT station this morning? B: _____ _____. She was standing right next to me!"},{"w":"No way!","p":"phr.","d":"used to say something is impossible or you won't do it","c":"不可能！；門都沒有！","s":"A: Can I copy your math homework before class starts? B: _____ _____! You should do it by yourself like everyone else."},{"w":"not + V + until + 時間/子句","p":"phr.","d":"only at that time, not before","c":"直到⋯⋯才","s":"My dad did _____ come home _____ eleven o'clock last night because he had a lot of work at the office."},{"w":"not + V + yet","p":"phr.","d":"not until now; still not","c":"還沒⋯⋯","s":"I have _____ finished my science project _____, so I can't go to the movies with you tonight."},{"w":"not + V/adj. + at all","p":"phr.","d":"not in any way","c":"一點也不……、完全不……","s":"I did _____ like the movie _____ _____ because the story was boring and the ending was too sad for me."},{"w":"Oh my goodness!","p":"phr.","d":"used when you are very surprised or sad","c":"天啊！（表示吃驚或悲傷）","s":"A: Did you hear that our teacher won first prize in the singing contest? B: _____ _____ _____! That's amazing news!"},{"w":"once + 現在簡單式, S + 未來式","p":"phr.","d":"as soon as something happens","c":"一旦……就……","s":"_____ you learn how to ride a bike, you will never forget it, even if you don't ride for many years."},{"w":"one ..., another ..., the other ...（三者）","p":"phr.","d":"used to talk about three things or people","c":"一個…；另一個…；剩下那個…","s":"Amy bought three gifts for her friends: _____ is a pen, _____ is a notebook, and _____ _____ is a cute key chain."},{"w":"one ..., the other ...（兩者）","p":"phr.","d":"used to talk about two things or people","c":"一個…；另一個…（兩者中的）","s":"Peter has two pets at home; _____ is a white cat, and _____ _____ is a little brown dog named Coffee."},{"w":"one of the + 最高級 + N(複數)","p":"phr.","d":"among the most … ones","c":"最⋯⋯之一","s":"Taipei 101 is _____ _____ _____ tallest buildings in the world, and many tourists visit it every year."},{"w":"one's mind goes blank","p":"phr.","d":"suddenly you cannot think or remember anything","c":"腦袋一片空白","s":"When the teacher asked me to stand up and answer the question, my _____ _____ _____ and I couldn't say a word."}]},{"unit":4,"theme":"Please be seated. – 句子, though.","cards":[{"w":"Please be seated.","p":"phr.","d":"a polite way to tell people to sit down","c":"請坐下（較正式）","s":"A: Good morning, everyone. The speech contest will start in five minutes. B: _____ _____ _____, and please turn off your phones."},{"w":"pull a long face","p":"phr.","d":"look unhappy or sad","c":"拉長臉；不高興","s":"When Mom said we couldn't go to the beach because of the rain, my sister _____ _____ _____ _____ all afternoon."},{"w":"S + once + 過去式動詞","p":"phr.","d":"at one time in the past","c":"曾經；以前（某段時間）","s":"My grandfather _____ lived in a small village in the mountains, and he walked two hours to school every day."},{"w":"S + V + if + 未來式","p":"phr.","d":"asks or tells whether something will happen later","c":"間接問句：未來是否會發生某事（= whether）","s":"I don't know _____ Grandma will visit us this weekend, because she hasn't called us back since Monday."},{"w":"S + V + when + 未來式","p":"phr.","d":"asks or tells at what time something will happen","c":"間接問句：（問／不知道）未來何時會發生某事","s":"My little brother keeps asking Mom _____ Dad will come home from his business trip in Japan, so she shows him the calendar."},{"w":"S + V + whether + 未來式","p":"phr.","d":"asks or tells if something will happen later","c":"間接問句：未來是否會發生某事","s":"Kevin is not sure _____ his team will win the basketball game next week, so he practices hard every day after school."},{"w":"See you later.","p":"phr.","d":"goodbye; I will see you soon","c":"待會見；回頭見","s":"A: I have to go to my piano lesson now. B: OK, _____ _____ _____! Let's meet at the park after dinner."},{"w":"Seeing is believing.","p":"phr.","d":"You believe it when you see it yourself.","c":"眼見為憑","s":"A: My cousin says there are pink dolphins in Hong Kong. B: Really? I want to go there, because _____ _____ _____."},{"w":"So long.","p":"phr.","d":"goodbye","c":"再見。","s":"A: My bus is coming, so I have to go now. See you next week! B: _____ _____, Jenny! Have a nice weekend."},{"w":"Stop bugging me.","p":"phr.","d":"stop annoying me","c":"別煩我了（俚語）","s":"A: Can I play with your new video game? Please, please, please! B: _____ _____ _____. I'm doing my homework right now."},{"w":"such a + adj. + N","p":"phr.","d":"used to make a singular noun stronger","c":"這麼⋯⋯的（+ 單數可數名詞）","s":"Thank you for making my birthday cake by yourself, Grandma! You are _____ _____ kind person, and I love you so much."},{"w":"such a + adj. + N = so + adj. + a + N","p":"phr.","d":"used to say a thing is very something","c":"如此…的…（如：如此短的裙子）","s":"Grandma was surprised when Amy wore _____ _____ short skirt to the family dinner, so Amy put on long pants instead."},{"w":"take + 人's breath away","p":"phr.","d":"make someone surprised by beauty","c":"令人屏息；令人驚艷","s":"When we reached the top of Jade Mountain, the beautiful sunrise _____ our _____ _____, and nobody said a word."},{"w":"Talk to you later.","p":"phr.","d":"goodbye; we will talk again soon","c":"待會再聊","s":"A: My mom is calling me for dinner, so I have to go now. B: No problem. _____ _____ _____ _____!"},{"w":"That was close.","p":"phr.","d":"said when something bad almost happened","c":"好險；差一點","s":"A: Wow, that ball almost hit the window of our classroom! B: _____ _____ _____! Let's play somewhere else next time."},{"w":"the + 最高級 + (that) I have ever + p.p.","p":"phr.","d":"the most … in my whole life","c":"我曾經⋯⋯過的最⋯⋯","s":"This is _____ best beef noodle soup _____ _____ _____ eaten, and I want to come back to this shop tomorrow."},{"w":"the last + 人 + to + VR","p":"phr.","d":"the person least likely to do something","c":"最不可能…的人","s":"Ken is very honest and kind, so he is _____ _____ person _____ tell a lie to his friends or teachers."},{"w":"the last thing + 人 + want to + VR","p":"phr.","d":"something you really do not want to do","c":"最不想做的事","s":"After a long day at cram school, _____ _____ _____ Jason _____ _____ do is wash the dishes, but his mom asks him to."},{"w":"the last thing I would do","p":"phr.","d":"something I would never do","c":"我最不可能做的事","s":"Lying to my parents is _____ _____ _____ _____ _____ _____, because they always trust me and I love them."},{"w":"The less, the better.","p":"phr.","d":"less of it is better","c":"越少越好","s":"A: How much sugar do you want in your green tea? B: _____ _____, _____ _____. I'm trying to eat healthier this year."},{"w":"The more, the better.","p":"phr.","d":"more of it is better","c":"越多越好","s":"A: How many apples should I buy for the fruit salad? B: _____ _____, _____ _____! Everyone in my family loves apples."},{"w":"The more, the merrier.","p":"phr.","d":"more people make it more fun","c":"人越多越熱鬧","s":"A: Can I bring my cousins to your barbecue party this Saturday? B: Sure! _____ _____, _____ _____!"},{"w":"The report says + that 子句","p":"phr.","d":"the news story tells us that","c":"報導指出","s":"_____ _____ _____ that it will rain heavily this weekend, so we should move the picnic to next Saturday."},{"w":"the way + S + used to","p":"phr.","d":"like someone did in the past","c":"像（某人）以前那樣","s":"Ken and Joe still play basketball together every Sunday, just _____ _____ they _____ _____ in junior high school."},{"w":"There is a market for + N","p":"phr.","d":"many people want to buy this","c":"對……有市場需求","s":"Many families have pets now, so _____ _____ _____ _____ _____ healthy pet food in Taiwan."},{"w":"There is no point + V-ing","p":"phr.","d":"it is not useful or worth doing something","c":"做⋯⋯沒有意義","s":"_____ _____ _____ _____ waiting for the bus in this heavy rain, so let's just take a taxi to the train station."},{"w":"There is no use + V-ing","p":"phr.","d":"it is useless to do something","c":"做⋯⋯沒有用","s":"_____ _____ _____ _____ crying about the lost game now, so let's practice harder for the next one."},{"w":"There's no way through.","p":"phr.","d":"you cannot pass this road or place","c":"沒有通路；過不去","s":"A: Can we take this road to the beach? B: No, a big tree fell across it last night. _____ _____ _____ _____."},{"w":"This is the least I can do.","p":"phr.","d":"it is only a small thing to help you","c":"這是我起碼能做的（一點小事）","s":"A: Thank you so much for carrying these heavy boxes upstairs. B: You helped me with math last week, so _____ _____ _____ _____ _____ _____ _____."},{"w":"句子, though.","p":"phr.","d":"however (at the end of a sentence)","c":"不過；然而（放在句尾）","s":"The movie we saw last night was a little long. It was very funny, _____, so we all enjoyed it a lot."}]},{"unit":5,"theme":"Time is up. – You only live once.","cards":[{"w":"Time is up.","p":"phr.","d":"There is no more time left.","c":"時間到了","s":"A: Please put your pencils down, everyone. _____ _____ _____. B: Oh no, I still have two questions left to answer!"},{"w":"too + adj./adv. + to + VR","p":"phr.","d":"so much that you cannot do something","c":"太……以致不能……","s":"My little brother is _____ young _____ ride the roller coaster, so he waited with Mom and ate ice cream instead."},{"w":"too good to be true","p":"phr.","d":"so good that it is hard to believe","c":"好得令人難以置信","s":"The ad said we could get a new phone for only ten dollars, but it sounded _____ _____ _____ _____ _____."},{"w":"Trick or treat!","p":"phr.","d":"what children say on Halloween to get candy","c":"不給糖就搗蛋","s":"On Halloween night, the children in costumes knocked on our door and shouted, \"_____ _____ _____!\" so we gave them candy."},{"w":"turn a blind eye to + N","p":"phr.","d":"pretend not to see something wrong","c":"對⋯⋯視而不見","s":"A good teacher should never _____ _____ _____ _____ _____ bullying, because every student needs to feel safe at school."},{"w":"turn a deaf ear to + N","p":"phr.","d":"not listen to someone on purpose","c":"對⋯⋯充耳不聞","s":"Mom told Peter many times to stop playing games late at night, but he always _____ _____ _____ _____ _____ her."},{"w":"Understood?","p":"phr.","d":"Do you understand?","c":"懂了嗎？","s":"A: Remember to wear your helmet every time you ride your bike to school. _____? B: Yes, Dad, I will always wear it."},{"w":"V-ing + takes + 人 + 時間","p":"phr.","d":"doing this needs this much time","c":"做⋯⋯花某人多少時間","s":"Cleaning the whole house _____ my family about three hours every Sunday, so we always order pizza for lunch."},{"w":"Way to go.","p":"phr.","d":"used to say someone did a great job","c":"幹得好！；做得好！","s":"A: Mom, I got first place in the school swimming race today! B: _____ _____ _____. I knew all your practice would help."},{"w":"What + 疑問句 + for?","p":"phr.","d":"used to ask why or for what reason","c":"為了什麼","s":"A: _____ did you buy so many eggs and so much flour _____? B: I'm going to bake a big cake for Grandma's birthday."},{"w":"What a play!","p":"phr.","d":"That was a great move in a game!","c":"好球！（比賽中的感嘆）","s":"A: Did you see Chen just catch the ball with one hand and throw it to first base? B: Wow! _____ _____ _____!"},{"w":"What do you have in mind?","p":"phr.","d":"a question asking about someone's idea or plan","c":"你有什麼想法？","s":"A: Let's do something special for Mom's birthday this Sunday. B: Good idea! _____ _____ _____ _____ _____ _____?"},{"w":"What else …?","p":"phr.","d":"which other thing?","c":"還有什麼","s":"A: I bought milk, eggs, and flour at the supermarket. B: Thanks! _____ _____ do we need for the cake tonight?"},{"w":"What kinds of + N?","p":"phr.","d":"used to ask about the types of something","c":"什麼種類的…？","s":"A: _____ _____ _____ books do you usually borrow from the library? B: I like comic books and stories about animals best."},{"w":"What/How about + N/V-ing?","p":"phr.","d":"used to make a suggestion or ask an opinion","c":"…如何？；…怎麼樣？","s":"A: I'm bored, and it's too hot to play basketball outside. B: _____ _____ watching a movie at my house this afternoon?"},{"w":"What's on your mind?","p":"phr.","d":"a question asking what someone is thinking about","c":"你在想什麼？","s":"A: You have been quiet all day. _____ _____ _____ _____? B: I'm worried about tomorrow's math test."},{"w":"What's the catch?","p":"phr.","d":"What is the hidden problem?","c":"有什麼陷阱？（口語）","s":"A: This shop is selling new phones for only one thousand dollars today! B: Really? _____ _____ _____? It sounds too good to be true."},{"w":"What's the matter?","p":"phr.","d":"a question asking what is wrong","c":"怎麼了？","s":"A: _____ _____ _____? You look very sad today. B: I lost my new bike at the park yesterday."},{"w":"What's up?","p":"phr.","d":"What is happening? / What's wrong?","c":"什麼事？怎麼了？","s":"A: Hi, Wendy! You look worried today. _____ _____? B: I lost my bus card, and I don't know how to get home."},{"w":"What's your take on + N?","p":"phr.","d":"What do you think about it?","c":"你對⋯⋯有什麼看法？","s":"A: _____ _____ _____ _____ the new rule about using phones at school? B: I think it is fair, but a little strict."},{"w":"When + 過去簡單式, 主詞 + 過去簡單式.","p":"phr.","d":"one past action happened at the time of another","c":"當過去某事發生時，另一件事也發生了","s":"_____ I got home yesterday afternoon, my dog ran to the door and jumped on me happily."},{"w":"whether + 現在簡單式 (or not), S + 未來式","p":"phr.","d":"something will happen in both cases","c":"條件句：無論某事是否發生，都將會……","s":"_____ it is sunny _____ _____ this Saturday, we will still go to the night market with our cousins from Taichung."},{"w":"Which way are you heading?","p":"phr.","d":"asks where someone is going","c":"你要往哪走？","s":"A: I'm leaving the library now, Peter. B: Me too. _____ _____ _____ _____ _____? Maybe we can walk together."},{"w":"Who else …?","p":"phr.","d":"which other person?","c":"還有誰","s":"A: Jenny and Mark are coming to my birthday party on Saturday. B: Great! _____ _____ is coming?"},{"w":"would + VR（過去習慣）","p":"phr.","d":"did something often in the past","c":"過去常常（表習慣）= used to","s":"When I was a child, my grandmother _____ take me to the morning market every Sunday and buy me soy milk."},{"w":"You bet.","p":"phr.","d":"used to say \"yes, of course\" strongly","c":"當然；沒錯（強烈肯定）","s":"A: Are you coming to watch my basketball game on Saturday afternoon? B: _____ _____! I wouldn't miss it for anything."},{"w":"You can say that again.","p":"phr.","d":"used to say you agree completely","c":"完全同意；沒錯（口語）","s":"A: This math test was so hard, and I didn't finish the last page. B: _____ _____ _____ _____ _____. I almost cried."},{"w":"You only live once.","p":"phr.","d":"enjoy life and try new things now","c":"人生只有一次；及時行樂","s":"A: I'm a little scared to try the big roller coaster at the theme park. B: Come on! _____ _____ _____ _____. Let's go!"}]},{"unit":6,"theme":"綜合練習 Practice Q1–30","cards":[{"w":"Are you kidding?","p":"phr.","d":"Are you joking?","c":"你在開玩笑吧？","s":""},{"w":"Don't cross him.","p":"phr.","d":"don't make someone angry","c":"別惹⋯⋯生氣","s":""},{"w":"It's now or never.","p":"phr.","d":"do it now or lose the chance","c":"機不可失；此時不做更待何時","s":""},{"w":"I second that.","p":"phr.","d":"I agree with what you just said","c":"我附議／我贊同（正式或幽默用法）","s":""},{"w":"It took my breath away.","p":"","d":"","c":"A：阿里山的日出怎麼樣？","s":""},{"w":"I don't mind.","p":"phr.","d":"it's OK with me","c":"我不介意","s":""},{"w":"Best wishes","p":"phr.","d":"kind hopes written at the end of a card","c":"致上最誠摯的祝福","s":""},{"w":"I've got it covered.","p":"phr.","d":"I will take care of it; it is done","c":"搞定；處理好了","s":""},{"w":"I'm not tired at all.","p":"","d":"","c":"A：你今天早上跑了十公里。你累嗎？","s":""},{"w":"Don't judge a book by its cover.","p":"phr.","d":"don't decide what someone is like from their looks","c":"不可貌相；別以貌取人","s":""},{"w":"Time is up.","p":"phr.","d":"There is no more time left.","c":"時間到了","s":""},{"w":"First things first.","p":"phr.","d":"do the most important thing first","c":"要事第一；先做重要的事","s":""},{"w":"A deal is a deal.","p":"phr.","d":"you must do what you promised","c":"說好的事就要算數","s":""},{"w":"It was a piece of cake.","p":"","d":"","c":"A：數學考試怎麼樣？","s":""},{"w":"I don't know if she will come.","p":"","d":"","c":"A：珍妮會來你的生日派對嗎？","s":""},{"w":"If only I could fly!","p":"phr.","d":"I really wish","c":"但願、要是……多好","s":""},{"w":"I don't get it.","p":"phr.","d":"I do not understand.","c":"我不懂","s":""},{"w":"You only live once.","p":"phr.","d":"enjoy life and try new things now","c":"人生只有一次；及時行樂","s":""},{"w":"It's my turn.","p":"phr.","d":"Now I can do it after others.","c":"輪到我了","s":""},{"w":"Have you ever been to Japan?","p":"phr.","d":"did you visit this place before?","c":"你曾經去過⋯⋯嗎？","s":""},{"w":"Neither did I.","p":"phr.","d":"me too, for a negative idea","c":"（前句否定）⋯⋯也不","s":""},{"w":"It's my pleasure to","p":"phr.","d":"I am happy and honored to do this","c":"很樂意做⋯⋯／是我的榮幸做⋯⋯","s":""},{"w":"It's your call.","p":"phr.","d":"you can decide","c":"由你決定；看你怎麼選","s":""},{"w":"I'll run as fast as possible.","p":"","d":"","c":"A：快點！末班公車三分鐘後就要開了！","s":""},{"w":"What's the catch?","p":"phr.","d":"What is the hidden problem?","c":"有什麼陷阱？（口語）","s":""},{"w":"That's the last thing I would do.","p":"","d":"","c":"A：你考試時抄湯姆的答案嗎？","s":""},{"w":"He is as tall as I am.","p":"","d":"","c":"A：你哥哥比你高嗎？","s":""},{"w":"It's up to you.","p":"phr.","d":"You can decide.","c":"由你決定；看你怎麼選","s":""},{"w":"No kidding.","p":"phr.","d":"I am telling the truth; really.","c":"不騙你；真的","s":""},{"w":"Don't be in my way.","p":"phr.","d":"please move; you are blocking me","c":"別擋我的路。","s":""}]},{"unit":7,"theme":"綜合練習 Practice Q31–60","cards":[{"w":"pulled a long face","p":"phr.","d":"look unhappy or sad","c":"拉長臉；不高興","s":""},{"w":"Whether it rains or not, I will go.","p":"","d":"","c":"A：如果明天下雨，你還會去爬山嗎？","s":""},{"w":"It doesn't ring a bell.","p":"phr.","d":"I don't remember it.","c":"想不起來；沒印象（口語）","s":""},{"w":"Don't push me.","p":"phr.","d":"don't try to make me do something","c":"別逼我","s":""},{"w":"I'm not sure whether it will snow there.","p":"","d":"","c":"A：你這個週末要去山上嗎？","s":""},{"w":"I haven't finished reading it yet.","p":"","d":"","c":"A：我可以借你的新漫畫書嗎？","s":""},{"w":"He once lived in Japan.","p":"","d":"","c":"A：你爸爸日文為什麼說得這麼好？","s":""},{"w":"Stop bugging me.","p":"phr.","d":"stop annoying me","c":"別煩我了（俚語）","s":""},{"w":"I'll call you later.","p":"phr.","d":"I will phone you again soon","c":"我待會打給你","s":""},{"w":"Walking there takes me only five minutes.","p":"","d":"","c":"A：你到學校要花多久時間？","s":""},{"w":"It was better than I thought.","p":"","d":"","c":"A：那家新餐廳怎麼樣？","s":""},{"w":"Mind your own business.","p":"phr.","d":"don't ask about things that are not about you","c":"少管閒事","s":""},{"w":"Better late than never.","p":"phr.","d":"doing it late is better than not at all","c":"晚做總比不做好","s":""},{"w":"It's on me.","p":"phr.","d":"I will pay (spoken)","c":"我請客（口語）","s":""},{"w":"Am I clear?","p":"phr.","d":"Do you understand what I said?","c":"我說清楚了嗎？","s":""},{"w":"It's such a short skirt.","p":"","d":"","c":"A：為什麼艾咪不能穿那件裙子去學校？","s":""},{"w":"It's not a big deal.","p":"phr.","d":"It is not important; no problem.","c":"小事；沒什麼（= No biggie.）","s":""},{"w":"He didn't get up until ten.","p":"","d":"","c":"A：爸爸七點有和你一起吃早餐嗎？","s":""},{"w":"It's sick!","p":"phr.","d":"slang: it is really cool or great","c":"太厲害了；超棒（俚語）","s":""},{"w":"There's no point running after it.","p":"","d":"","c":"A：公車五分鐘前就開走了。我們追上去吧！","s":""},{"w":"Before I eat dinner, I will wash my hands.","p":"","d":"","c":"A：你什麼時候會洗手？","s":""},{"w":"Handle with care.","p":"phr.","d":"move this carefully because it can break","c":"小心處理（常見於包裹標示）","s":""},{"w":"Excuse me.","p":"phr.","d":"a polite way to ask someone to move or listen","c":"借光；對不起（禮貌用語）","s":""},{"w":"One is a dog, another is a cat, and the other is a bird.","p":"","d":"","c":"我有三隻寵物。一隻是狗，另一隻是貓，剩下那隻是鳥。","s":""},{"w":"What are you going to the store for?","p":"","d":"","c":"A：你去商店是為了什麼？","s":""},{"w":"Just the way you used to make them.","p":"","d":"","c":"A：凱文，我該怎麼幫你做水餃？","s":""},{"w":"A strong typhoon is hitting Taipei.","p":"","d":"","c":"A：為什麼今天不用上學？","s":""},{"w":"It was such a boring movie.","p":"","d":"","c":"A：你為什麼提早離開電影院？","s":""},{"w":"When I walked home, it started to rain.","p":"phr.","d":"one past action happened at the time of another","c":"當過去某事發生時，另一件事也發生了","s":""},{"w":"Once she gets home, I will tell her.","p":"","d":"","c":"A：你什麼時候要告訴媽媽這個好消息？","s":""}]}];
